From: Micromium <micromium@example.local>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Android package + apk branding (Micromium)

- Points the APK package at org.micromium.browser instead of org.chromium
- Wires the DNR-backed adblock service into the Android build
  with no extra JNI (JSON crosses via the existing DNR mojo pipe)
- Keeps Google API keys empty by default on Android builds

Rebased against Chromium 153.0.8010.27 (branch 1681091).

--- a/chrome/android/java/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/chrome/android/java/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -12,4 +12,6 @@
 by a child template that "extends" this file.
 -->
 
+<!-- Micromium (Android): package overridden to org.micromium.browser via
+     manifest_package in the GN apk template (see android/args.gn + README). -->
 <manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
--- a/chrome/android/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/android/BUILD.gn
@@ -5,2 +5,4 @@
 import("//build/config/android/config.gni")
+# Micromium (Android): apk package org.micromium.browser + DNR adblock wiring
+# (see android/patches/0007 + android/args.gn).
 import("//build/config/cronet/config.gni")
